  "details": "Point and victory/peace not detecting. All other gestures were detecting fine.\n\nTesting:\n\n1. Switched to an avatar with five fingers\n\n2. Verified finger tracking was correct. I could extend and curl each finger individually.\n\n3. Tested all gestures.\n\nI was able to do finger gun, but if I lowered my thumb with my index finger still extended it returned to neutral. If I instead did point first, it would stay in neutral, and extending the thumb would result in finger guns. All other attempts to produce point also failed. Rock and Roll also worked correctly.\n\nThe same is true for Peace. All attempts to produce peace/victory also failed to detect a gesture, but the hand position was shown correctly.\n\nAll other gestures registered correctly.\n\nThis may be related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1485gestures-do-not-work-properly-on-pico4\n\nFull build number: 2024.3.1-1486-1b738d3f44-Release",
